      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Dealing with children with acute abdominal pain is often difficult for family physicians. This article attempts to set out a reasonable, step-progressive, and logical approach to this clinical situation. Emphasis is placed on the practical aspects of the situation and the need for the child to be involved in the examination."},
